{"id":10000034,"name":"诺艾尔","enName":"Noelle","title":"未授勋之花","element":"岩","region":"蒙德","rarity":4,"weapon":"双手剑","birthday":"3月21日","constellation":"心护座","description":"「西风骑士团」的可靠女仆，梦想有一天能成为正式的骑士。","affiliation":"西风骑士团","cv":{"chinese":"宴宁","japanese":"高尾奏音","english":"劳拉·费伊·史密斯","korean":"李甫熙"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000034-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000034-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Noelle.zip","voicePackageEn":"Noelle","quoteCount":69,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"我是诺艾尔，西风骑士团的女仆，从今天起会陪你一起去冒险。如果遇到任何困扰或者麻烦，不用担心，我都会尽全力帮你解决的。嗯，现在就可以哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/h4idjj9ayd0qo12u6rghfjm7a75n71l.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·帮忙","desc":"交给我吧！什么都可以交给我！——对了，你要拜托我做什么来着？我还没来得及听…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_explore_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8b/0mvsp6baduqz91ebo5bvzf2nh9tathn.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·休息","desc":"有点累了吗？那就在这里休息吧，我去为你沏茶，要全糖、半糖，还是无糖？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_explore_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a0/ri6zmsapdrjzj1vovjbt3vtch8lqilk.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·可靠","desc":"只要你需要我，我随时都会出现在你的身边。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_explore_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/11/lon9vmpmzn8ul0h4x8rqkl68tqx2mdh.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"糟了，大家的衣服还晾在外面！我能不能现在回去收拾一下？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/10vacrs50rh2dvz91f6gx22xbmintyn.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"遇到打雷还是待在屋子里比较好哦，如果有非出门不可的事，就交给我吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/oavn0m44a9h0sjd5wsey4mq0cyee75t.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"天气晴朗，不如做一些和「阳光」有关的事吧。欸？具体一点…只要能让你的心情也变得晴朗的事，都可以。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c1/syrl7rktazygpfa4vr6cgq040vtvs73.mp3"},{"title":"起风的时候…","desc":"听见了吗？是风神的声音。每到我心烦意乱的时候，听见风声就能平静下来。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_weather_breezy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/1ia0c9sieyhmbfus8j390ibio3f7gyp.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早上好，早餐已经做好了哦。我就待在你身边，如果哪里不合口味，请随时告诉我。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4d/qlio9h4vfwcxatqo20e48gju4rwweog.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"想要坐下来喝杯茶吗？我去为你准备。对了，我还顺手准备了厚云朵松饼，是我的拿手菜哦，请一定要尝一尝。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/3kocwf4zxv1c03w1sza1ebodchwfq1z.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"晚上是大家的休息时间，也是我最忙的时候…安柏洗好的发带放在哪了？凯亚新买的眼罩有几套？我会全部记住的，这是女仆的责任。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/qsp6227ouhjgamrqk1zi86ji8gegiau.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"今天的冒险辛苦你了，请去休息吧。我还要回骑士团一趟…欸？要我守候你入睡吗？…唔…倒是没什么问题，不过…不是在捉弄我吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e7/fxahx2wwla0ahdjmhgf5nuilwkijmdc.mp3"},{"title":"关于诺艾尔自己·自律","desc":"我只是每天都做同样的事，和真正的骑士比起来还差远了…但这是通往骑士之路的修行，修行可不能只是嘴上说说而已啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/q527kp1rtmdgfg5uc7l25has3zj73th.mp3"},{"title":"关于诺艾尔自己·分歧","desc":"我有点不太擅长和别人争辩，很多时候说不清道理，还会惹别人生气，所以我就会先按我的想法去做，结果又被人说是「固执」了…我只是想用结果说服他而已，这也是「固执」吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/sxgxuzkt1r2kjhsj6njkw4jmq3dt6qr.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·身份","desc":"我的奉献是出于自由的奉献，「女仆」在我看来就是最自由的身份。厨师、园丁、战士、向导…你需要我是什么，我就是什么！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/tqo9owlh27z0rwkwwrwjn41xun71ysv.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·叮嘱","desc":"就算再怎么仓促，一日三餐也不能应付，不可以吃来历不明的东西，也不能光吃肉不吃蔬菜。对了，尽量不要喝冷水，对胃不好…唔，你不会在想「因为太麻烦所以还是交给诺艾尔」吧？唔唔…如果你真的这么想…好吧，还是交给我来吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/4iqf9ggmyj7vo0303hceakbt7c232to.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·欢迎会","desc":"我听说了，你成为了西风骑士团的荣誉骑士，真是羡慕啊…那今后你就是我的前辈了。对了，应该为你举办一场热闹的欢迎会！我现在就去准备！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_close2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/oorvvlcqbb6t8tlm21abf8jmgx1kal2.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"说实话，有些失望…虽然这「神之眼」象征神明对我的肯定，但为什么不是「风」，而是与风的性质相差最远的「岩」呢？我觉得最适合西风骑士团的元素，毕竟还是…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/93/ndxky09ovcx2ayh4v9evhdyb4c5wnmi.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"其实我很喜欢闻酒的味道，可是现在的我还没到喝酒的年纪…虽然不止一次有偷偷尝的机会，但我都忍住了，还是把这份神秘感保留到我成年的那一天吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_share","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/3zxrjmoe5w9az665hg5hbxcrv73nouq.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"女仆要严守秘密，所以我很喜欢玫瑰，玫瑰在蒙德就代表「守口如瓶」，它总是能提醒我…欸？在你的家乡，玫瑰代表「爱情」吗？…居、居然还有这么火热的含义啊…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/1vk0rhqzgqn6wtoym3cd3yip8dqprpy.mp3"},{"title":"关于安柏…","desc":"她是我非常尊敬的前辈，实力很强不说，对人也很亲切。她还教我怎么做「兔兔伯爵」，你看，我会把它当成护身符带在身边，做得不错吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_ambor_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/80/gkg35sxeplejjyozr7y0am61wvpzs10.mp3"},{"title":"关于可莉…","desc":"我一直很想知道，她还这么小，是怎么正式成为骑士的。有一次向她请教经验，她还没听完我的话，就拉着我去骑士团外面玩炸弹…我以为这是什么修行，结果最后我和她都被琴团长关了禁闭…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_klee_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/ii7lidngpphk329t9u8bz4vu0lgcd9i.mp3"},{"title":"关于琴…","desc":"琴团长一直都是我的榜样，我的实力和认真程度完全比不上她。她对别人就像对自己一样严格，所以如果有一天我能得到她的认可，那也是对我一直以来努力的最大肯定了。在那之前，我都是不会松懈的！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_qin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c6/otkcs8gcdwv9tka3vk5vuhsh864j9au.mp3"},{"title":"关于法尔伽…","desc":"本来我想跟着他的队伍一起去冒险，履行女仆的责任，但大团长说我留在蒙德他才不会有后顾之忧…大团长这么器重我，我特别开心！虽然后来我知道大团长不只对我一个人说了这句话，不过…器重就是器重嘛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_varka_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/0ovrplrrbg8reuqofqimk3iq2eqp4qb.mp3"},{"title":"关于凯亚…","desc":"他很神秘，来如影，去如风，每天都有很重要的任务要去处理。他还经常会给我安排一些小任务，就好像我已经是他的小队成员了一样…嗯？只是跑腿？不不不，虽然确实是跑腿，可是我很珍惜的！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_kaeya_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a5/0mzqabbgbgglptmdyqsnlj3d47zm7vu.mp3"},{"title":"关于班尼特…","desc":"他不止一次来邀请我，说什么比起骑士团，还是冒险家协会更适合我…虽然我是会像一个普通的冒险家一样，帮他照顾他的老爹们，但…骑士团对我来说有特别的意义，而且我也不想认输…嗯，果然还是没法答应。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_bennett_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/nf3cmlht85mxbzbwly32b0578etxtbd.mp3"},{"title":"关于菲谢尔·茶点","desc":"她好像是从别的世界来的，其他的我也不清楚…不过她好像很喜欢骑士团的图书馆，总是在那里看书。我打扫的时候会送去一些热乎乎的茶点，她每次都会感谢我，还会说很多听不明白，但都很夸张的话…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_fischl_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/jw9zz0uf2lnl0gvu7ebeftl76jrppnc.mp3"},{"title":"关于菲谢尔·身世","desc":"以前我打扫图书馆的时候，记得有本书叫《菲谢尔皇女夜谭》，我还以为只是幻想小说…但没想到，里面的主人公居然真的存在！能有一本自己的传记，她一定很厉害吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_fischl_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/10/s1g4f7fl7dx0qqd8xe6j4pmeb07tc43.mp3"},{"title":"关于芭芭拉…","desc":"我们经常在一起喝茶，有时候她会轻轻哼出很好听的调子，告诉我灵感来了。虽然我对音乐给不出什么实用的建议…但能跟芭芭拉享受这样的时光，我真的非常高兴！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_teammate_barbara_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2b/5xu06cvaqp01fw2cjh823fryq02rqug.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解诺艾尔·其一","desc":"是需要我帮忙吗？哦…只是想和我聊聊天，好吧，如果这就算帮上了你的忙，那想聊多久都可以。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/3gdl9yzzximmj5y0wehnudbvebn7qt9.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解诺艾尔·其二","desc":"没关系，什么样的事都可以交给我，不用照顾我的感受的…欸？那不是「女仆」而是「工具」？唔…工具做了很多事也不一定会开心吧，但我为你做的每件事，我都很有成就感哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2b/ctpcxhr1028cjarc3xb1p924lat0n8m.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解诺艾尔·其三","desc":"这、这些点心是送给我的吗？不不不，这怎么好意思呢？那…那我也要做很多点心作为回报！我现在就去，马上就去！半个小时…呜，最多一个小时就做好了。你可以先去做别的事，茶点很快就会热乎乎地端到你的面前！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/rmmjlems60x0mds5grlwvinmo0dz9yu.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解诺艾尔·其四","desc":"我每天做的都是一些琐碎的小事，但只要这些小事能帮到你的冒险、你的生活，我就会很开心…因为你的道谢，会让我觉得这些小事，也都有小小的意义。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/0u3pioveymijj0tuyviiki3ujnbtoc5.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解诺艾尔·其五","desc":"我是为骑士团服务的女仆，也一直想要帮到更多人的忙。但不知不觉，用在你身上的时间已经变得越来越多了…唉，像我这样自私的做法，是不是…不太好？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/59/65jnrj2tsdg5rhqokt7grsjsmwsrtgk.mp3"},{"title":"诺艾尔的爱好…","desc":"爱好吗？我最喜欢洗各种各样的东西，洗衣服，洗地板，洗窗户，看到脏东西变干净我就会特别有成就感…欸？是指「休息时的爱好」？我想想…嗯，果然还是洗东西！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/rr57cc8ysn2hzgcfynz2sn16k87xikq.mp3"},{"title":"诺艾尔的烦恼…","desc":"该怎么用最少的预算、采购到最多最好的物资呢…我试过一个人跑去璃月比对所有商铺的价格、再一个人把东西全都搬回来…但那次花的时间太长，琴团长差点以为我在路上被风魔龙吃掉了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/6tmmxsafa0btba1crip3oc0qj8178jj.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"当然是「满足沙拉」，蒙德的自然水土汇于一盘，营养均衡，热量也不会超标…你问吃不腻吗？当然不会，很好吃的！我已经吃了十年了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/70/4fu1hgwwg0wl1danhqdpduwitzu54x6.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"我不挑食！但有一种情况会让我比较头疼…宴会上的一大桌菜，作为女仆，每一道菜都必须自己先尝一尝。但这样一口接一口…唉，太罪恶了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/7ydg7mkurko4rzr44t7x0ff29uvtrbs.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"能把普通的菜肴做得那么好吃…我对你的钦佩，又多了一些！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/00ljyei8vieyhn0mv3fmswxumta4wil.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"味道真好。我也要向你学习！再怎么说，这也是女仆的职责…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b7/m7676nspbgkmh49eanj06szb1bv3ca7.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"热量…会不会已经超过一整天的份额了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/ppzy1bdscv3wn4a1wmuetrv1brz2og1.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"每天都忙于冒险，是不是积压了很多琐事来不及处理？今天我就是你的专属女仆，全都交给我吧！还有…在这最棒的一天，祝你生日快乐！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/5cr3z9c5jd65ndwqlk2b2n97cf8i8ej.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"这就是…新的力量？谢谢你，这样我就能帮到更多人了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/17jprnhyv0sntr1dlqxff8c2kffwzob.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"还不能满足，在成为正式的西风骑士之前，我都要加倍努力。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/a1tdd9jz2y505nwa6cf4kl8bjg67wh6.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"多亏了能和你一起冒险，我才获得了这么多的成长。明明女仆的职责是为你排忧解难，结果反倒是让你为我花了这么多心思…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/3u1326tnxr4oavigzc7ccu1azd12drg.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"蒙德城的大家都说我变得比以前更可靠了，还说我马上就能成为真正的西风骑士了，但其实我…什么？你也这么觉得？呃…谢谢你能这么说，这是对我最好的夸奖！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_noel/vo_noel_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/44/rynfi4kk1yvguabb5kxhmmn1ofz3zka.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"岩石的重量，令人安心。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/kr89wxj97yfvtyh28zni3s99jr09i85.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"一定要干净利落。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/sgwz6qx2acosfdals69kygr8v4qdx2n.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"交给我吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/e20jzerlycxg21gw3w17jivqc5e475j.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"该打扫战场了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/6gbxes0ptmgmaed5vo8nq0eoeo24cmi.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"我会注意骑士的风度。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b6/p7y8dnkvnuu06c4vzxkvq2t4fzqjgmh.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"我会注意女仆的礼仪。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/59/n983v83159c1n2h3noig9gww9o0qidk.mp3"},{"title":"冲刺开始·其一","desc":"应该赶得上。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_explore_sprint_start_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fb/sgknou8vqm6nj5alnyxhyslrfc3ejxi.mp3"},{"title":"冲刺开始·其二","desc":"还有人需要帮忙。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_explore_sprint_start_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/md46ws99wo7ao4yqlxfq68avo4p0ac7.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"心满意足。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/96/2tgmlhlj4xl3lzhhi1lbntc4ao4c1r6.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"真高兴…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/oagcxnttko9coy2lni1duen65rq1lkf.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"这些宝藏积灰了，先清洗一下！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/s82ptpgrs166e2bzzz8xxoz3e1yxfp4.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"没关系，轻伤而已。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/f44kwdowdzjhkcumdleodo0witxsrb3.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"唔，衣服都弄脏了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/546y1qzfl9fyq7i6kvgxc7gk9madpcq.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"我不会退缩的。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/s948as548x8oc1nhbzxltm3r5neb4u8.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"别动，小心伤口，我来治疗！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0a/o2bprhh8ov3uezqdpd4mfx8zaqwufxz.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"交给我吧！换我来！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f6/b7py7jeg206mv15in4mhnoihev9ktxm.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"让骑士团…蒙羞了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/n4vdp6zoxj07tnie637rffhoddzawcr.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"我还想…保护大家…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/jvah8v2d1j4ntoki3ym9oz1w462pmlc.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"再见了…主人…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6e/iohxjivi3bcxd62bkulj1sug2wg1wx9.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"唔…失态了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_noel/vo_noel_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/r69t0qawjul3pzqiild3yxz7nu3uyyw.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"真高兴…啊、嗯。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_noel_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/7ipx4v9q9m2eo72be775dzabf77mp4e.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"一定会保护你。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_noel_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/a5by1yxnr23g1yjpn8fdzxf29sg3ad4.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"嗯，如你所愿。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_noel_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5e/cdwxe7dsmdyvqgse9g4dk46zbbz0ey7.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000034-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000034-full.webp","fullArtWidth":920,"fullArtHeight":825}